meta {
  name: Phase01-Login
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Re-login every demo participant + admin. Captures `<name>_token` and
  `<name>_id` for downstream use. Always safe to re-run.

  ⚠️ Temi is INTENTIONALLY OMITTED. The user spec says her inspection +
  notification state must not be touched by the demo prep — leaving her
  out of every collection guarantees no demo script can accidentally
  use her token.
}
